{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/cc722681ae76bb00306216aa0c3f792f.avif?t=1774168339\" width=700 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ship Repair Business, But Lovecraftian</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunken Engine</strong> is a ship repair simulation game with a distinctive Lovecraftian atmosphere. After your father\u2019s untimely death, you must keep the business you inherited alive. This means not only repairing ships but also keeping customers satisfied, maintaining the town\u2019s order, and uncovering the mysteries your father left behind. Yet every new ship brings new challenges and ominous secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/0573079f9a90ce8f6628459705e3e020.poster.avif?t=1774168339\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/0573079f9a90ce8f6628459705e3e020.webm?t=1774168339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Horror and Sanity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The supernatural events you face during daily work will threaten your sanity. Losing your mental balance not only makes your job harder but may also attract the attention of dark entities. To survive, you must find ways to protect your mind, continue your work, and keep your wits if you wish to discover your father\u2019s true legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/dbdc678800d5945473822a86f529736c.poster.avif?t=1774168339\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/dbdc678800d5945473822a86f529736c.webm?t=1774168339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sunken Ship\u2019s Goods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repairing is not the only way to sustain your business. You can sell valuable loot recovered from the sea at the stall behind your shop. The economy is difficult for everyone in town; you must care for your family while keeping the business alive. Sometimes, this means stepping beyond conventional ways to earn profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/f9c0f3439c3396e7e3662123ee0e4094.poster.avif?t=1774168339\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/f9c0f3439c3396e7e3662123ee0e4094.webm?t=1774168339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Repair the Ships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your town is located in the middle of a busy sea route. Ships of various sizes and types dock for repairs, and it is your duty to meet the captains\u2019 needs. Fixing damages is vital not just for your business but for the safety of the entire region. Yet some repairs may require more than just your tools\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/cb8f20fe59667ec6432002d9162d6907.poster.avif?t=1774168339\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/cb8f20fe59667ec6432002d9162d6907.webm?t=1774168339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization and Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can renovate and improve your shop as you wish. By customizing your tools, workspace, and decorations, you can impress customers and bring to life the workshop your father once dreamed of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/c2cc40ce7fd5ad43d18dd647d527679f.poster.avif?t=1774168339\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604780/extras/c2cc40ce7fd5ad43d18dd647d527679f.webm?t=1774168339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ships and Licenses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll learn to repair more ships and, with new licenses, take on more complex work. Each license opens the door to new types of ships and new challenges. But remember: not every ship is just a repair job\u2014some bring with them dark stories and sinister secrets. Be cautious\u2026</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Trade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3604780/c1e717170b20cf76f5a775104a3a51026152620f.jpg"},{"name":"What's That?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3604780/76d1868018e54dbd25d7aa0b0678f29bac7567ae.jpg"},{"name":"Just Business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3604780/9421af4cca8f9460abd098b1ae8addef91a8d3aa.jpg"},{"name":"Trash Collector","path":"ht